SUMMARY:Frog Walk (Durham)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Durham Wildlife Stewards Chapter for a frog walk at Sandy Creek Park with Dr. Nicolette Cagle. We will spend the evening looking and listening for frog friends in the wetlands of the Park. We’ll listen for bull and green frogs by the water along with Cope’s Gray Treefrogs\, Fowler’s Toads\, Cricket Frogs\, and more. Join us for a “ribbiting” walk! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/frog-walk-durham/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/frogs-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
